{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Twins 2 is an incredibly cute puzzle platformer that will challenge your mind to the fullest. Each carefully crafted logical puzzle dares you to think harder, push further, and fight for that \u2018aha!\u2019 moment of victory. Challenges get increasingly tough yet always fair! Only the most brilliant minds will guide Abi and Ben on their journey to find a way back home across a whimsical polygonal playground built with an enormous amount of care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/4f41360cf2f88755de7fdbb02ca4018d.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/edb61524105da5c0c4f321ad1edfd7ae.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/edb61524105da5c0c4f321ad1edfd7ae.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up the twins! Explore brand new skins that let you customize Ben &amp; Abi with fun, colorful designs. Stand out in style, mix and match looks, and give the twins a fresh new vibe in every adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/30a051e125b9f041b873f9f98570f14e.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/c1fe03402a8b6866c149f75924cf8ade.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/c1fe03402a8b6866c149f75924cf8ade.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a splash with the new water levels! Ride currents, bounce on floating platforms, and use the\u00a0 buoyancy to solve clever puzzles. Flow, float, and experiment with exciting water mechanics that add a whole new layer of fun to the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/b2d63f1b053ee63b3bf575aa5331b4af.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/693aba245cd2c1283590e4fee1ace93d.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/693aba245cd2c1283590e4fee1ace93d.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute? Absolutely. Easy? Not a chance. Puzzles are designed to put your brain to test. Each puzzle demands logic, patience, reason, and creativity. Solve them, and you\u2019ll feel like a genius. Get stuck, and you\u2019ll see why so many never make it through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/0c5e67465b5edb9958a5a790f7512730.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/4b52709db6f8fd2e3eac929128253ab1.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/4b52709db6f8fd2e3eac929128253ab1.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/4b52709db6f8fd2e3eac929128253ab1.mp4?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A signature sliding puzzle mechanic forms the core of this game, where you slide the environment itself to create new paths ahead. Complemented by elements such as pressure switches, vehicles, breakable domes, lifts, flying dragonflies, and more to ensure that the pace of the game never falters. There's no repetition in the puzzles, each new puzzle will feel interesting and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/ad1648ad414307f613456a8bc0f8a6ee.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/28bc5e8b44d31ab78eabcca26578c585.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/28bc5e8b44d31ab78eabcca26578c585.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in co-op mode and solve puzzles together! Work with a friend to swap tiles, activate mechanisms, and overcome obstacles as you combine two minds together to take on the game\u2019s ever-increasing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/bc4c4ffc6db5e796113e1a1536aec803.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/3d66f3373266322c2941e875b092bcd9.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/3d66f3373266322c2941e875b092bcd9.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Miyazaki, the art style merges soft, painterly backgrounds with simplified, memorable characters and fluid animations. Each frame is crafted meticulously with pride, specific lighting techniques, thoughtful composition, and immense attention to detail mean that every single moment you'll spend playing Lost Twins 2 will be a feast for the eyes. The original musical score is atmospheric, soothing, and thematic to complement the art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/73e26358de41119d737fe37d83fc18bf.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/08fb8925a233e2558436eab8e946189e.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/08fb8925a233e2558436eab8e946189e.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its gameplay experience is rooted in discovery, tinkering, and exploration. There are no timers, no enemies, no deaths, and no dialogue to slow you down. Just a poetic, visually breathtaking world full of puzzles that will truly test your wits. Relaxing in tone, but demanding in thought, Lost Twins 2 offers a cerebral adventure that rewards patience and creativity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Zoom Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1752540/34a8e1f85ec338eb3e32d7a4b9db5bcd20c1cc1a.jpg"},{"name":"Ladies First","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1752540/33a139cc2da406a91dff7dcef7455be9a73e397e.jpg"},{"name":"Feather Collector Abi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1752540/7e0b814eeaff9caf31add972fc06e3d517267b9b.jpg"},{"name":"Two-Move Maestro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1752540/e3b6d8a575df31da6cb1c5f113a5f01325f568c9.jpg"},{"name":"Feather Quest with Abi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1752540/59473f855bb2eafdf237d292401b637663e5bb3d.jpg"},{"name":"Box Drop Virtuoso","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1752540/65b30e438520d0ff9128b35b3a6b66f4c34cd802.jpg"},{"name":"Shuffle Strategist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1752540/f66287e9fc9b195f04ebdd8b8311574ec4a5e5a8.jpg"},{"name":"Boulder Banishment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1752540/c0b3eec143c6c630acfec1772a19a485c88491d3.jpg"},{"name":"Strategic Boulder Drop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1752540/34ac7326cb87d2c456fdafeb21cb49021ea09e5c.jpg"},{"name":"Mushroom Jumper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1752540/33eb578365068edea40240fc1604747af7618f13.jpg"}],"total":48},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1752540?t=1765780793","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/3555889fc880b8803a5441cf06b02ff8eceab2eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765780793","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/ea60e519ccf6da2da7eaf9864c8401342e0e34f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765780793","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/ea60e519ccf6da2da7eaf9864c8401342e0e34f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765780793","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2078960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Awards</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best Puzzle Game - ChinaJoy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People Choice Award - ChinaJoy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pro PC Game of the Year - GDWC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Twins 2 is an incredibly cute puzzle platformer that will challenge your mind to the fullest. Each carefully crafted logical puzzle dares you to think harder, push further, and fight for that \u2018aha!\u2019 moment of victory. Challenges get increasingly tough yet always fair! Only the most brilliant minds will guide Abi and Ben on their journey to find a way back home across a whimsical polygonal playground built with an enormous amount of care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/4f41360cf2f88755de7fdbb02ca4018d.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/edb61524105da5c0c4f321ad1edfd7ae.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/edb61524105da5c0c4f321ad1edfd7ae.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up the twins! Explore brand new skins that let you customize Ben &amp; Abi with fun, colorful designs. Stand out in style, mix and match looks, and give the twins a fresh new vibe in every adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/30a051e125b9f041b873f9f98570f14e.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/c1fe03402a8b6866c149f75924cf8ade.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/c1fe03402a8b6866c149f75924cf8ade.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a splash with the new water levels! Ride currents, bounce on floating platforms, and use the\u00a0 buoyancy to solve clever puzzles. Flow, float, and experiment with exciting water mechanics that add a whole new layer of fun to the puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/b2d63f1b053ee63b3bf575aa5331b4af.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/693aba245cd2c1283590e4fee1ace93d.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/693aba245cd2c1283590e4fee1ace93d.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute? Absolutely. Easy? Not a chance. Puzzles are designed to put your brain to test. Each puzzle demands logic, patience, reason, and creativity. Solve them, and you\u2019ll feel like a genius. Get stuck, and you\u2019ll see why so many never make it through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/0c5e67465b5edb9958a5a790f7512730.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/4b52709db6f8fd2e3eac929128253ab1.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/4b52709db6f8fd2e3eac929128253ab1.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/4b52709db6f8fd2e3eac929128253ab1.mp4?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A signature sliding puzzle mechanic forms the core of this game, where you slide the environment itself to create new paths ahead. Complemented by elements such as pressure switches, vehicles, breakable domes, lifts, flying dragonflies, and more to ensure that the pace of the game never falters. There's no repetition in the puzzles, each new puzzle will feel interesting and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/ad1648ad414307f613456a8bc0f8a6ee.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/28bc5e8b44d31ab78eabcca26578c585.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/28bc5e8b44d31ab78eabcca26578c585.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in co-op mode and solve puzzles together! Work with a friend to swap tiles, activate mechanisms, and overcome obstacles as you combine two minds together to take on the game\u2019s ever-increasing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/bc4c4ffc6db5e796113e1a1536aec803.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/3d66f3373266322c2941e875b092bcd9.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/3d66f3373266322c2941e875b092bcd9.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Miyazaki, the art style merges soft, painterly backgrounds with simplified, memorable characters and fluid animations. Each frame is crafted meticulously with pride, specific lighting techniques, thoughtful composition, and immense attention to detail mean that every single moment you'll spend playing Lost Twins 2 will be a feast for the eyes. The original musical score is atmospheric, soothing, and thematic to complement the art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/73e26358de41119d737fe37d83fc18bf.avif?t=1765780793\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/08fb8925a233e2558436eab8e946189e.poster.avif?t=1765780793\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/extras/08fb8925a233e2558436eab8e946189e.webm?t=1765780793\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its gameplay experience is rooted in discovery, tinkering, and exploration. There are no timers, no enemies, no deaths, and no dialogue to slow you down. Just a poetic, visually breathtaking world full of puzzles that will truly test your wits. Relaxing in tone, but demanding in thought, Lost Twins 2 offers a cerebral adventure that rewards patience and creativity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Playdew"],"dlc":[3937120,3937070],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1752540/74fd3cded1142934b56728e038e23be557193d90/header.jpg?t=1765780793","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Pro 560X 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1752540/69501827/750638064bb6b380e0a952f8a079d3de41bb3c52/1759132013/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759133192","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1752540/69501827/750638064bb6b380e0a952f8a079d3de41bb3c52/1759132013/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759133192","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1752540/695018